### steps to create the dedicated Terraform user
Step 1 (create user): 
click on IAM Users > click create user (give user name [terraform-santosh]) > click next
Step 2 (Set permissions):
click on attach policies directly > search permissions policies called (AdministratorAccess) > click Next
Step 3 (Review and create):
review and click on (Create user)

### Once the user is created, give it a programmatic access
Step 1 (access key best practice and alternatives): 
click on the user Security credentials > click on (Create access key) in Access keys section > select Use case (Command Line Interface (CLI)) > click ([tick mark] understand the above recommendation and want to proceed to create an access key.) > click next
Step 2 (set description tag): 
we are not setting tag click (Create access key)
Step 3 (retrieve access keys):
Copy access key and the secret key as well, and save it on your notepad.

